{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_008","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"Experimental API: This API is experimental and subject to change. Endpoints, request/response formats, and behavior may be modified without notice.","location_hint":"paragraph 84","char_start":1794,"char_end":1941,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_009","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"The Comfy Cloud API provides programmatic access to run workflows on Comfy Cloud infrastructure. The API is compatible with local ComfyUI’s API, making it easy to migrate existing integrations.","location_hint":"paragraph 87","char_start":1967,"char_end":2160,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_010","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"Subscription Required: Running workflows via the API requires an active Comfy Cloud subscription. See pricing plans for details.","location_hint":"paragraph 88","char_start":2164,"char_end":2292,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_011","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"All API requests require an API key passed via the X-API-Key header.","location_hint":"paragraph 94","char_start":2362,"char_end":2430,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_012","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"Visit https://platform.comfy.org/login and Log In","location_hint":"paragraph 98","char_start":2468,"char_end":2517,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_013","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"Please visit https://platform.comfy.org/login and log in with the corresponding account","location_hint":"paragraph 99","char_start":2519,"char_end":2606,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_014","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"Click `+ New` in API Keys to Create an API Key","location_hint":"paragraph 101","char_start":2617,"char_end":2663,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_015","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"Click + New in API Keys to create an API Key","location_hint":"paragraph 102","char_start":2665,"char_end":2709,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_016","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"(Required) Enter the API Key name,","location_hint":"paragraph 105","char_start":2742,"char_end":2776,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_017","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"Since the API Key is only visible upon first creation, please save it immediately after creation. It cannot be viewed later, so please keep it safe.\nPlease note that you should not share your API Key with others. Once it leaked, you can delete it and create a new one.","location_hint":"paragraph 109","char_start":2846,"char_end":3114,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_018","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"Keep your API key secure. Never commit it to version control or share it publicly.","location_hint":"paragraph 110","char_start":3118,"char_end":3200,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_019","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"Pass your API key in the X-API-Key header with every request:","location_hint":"paragraph 113","char_start":3228,"char_end":3289,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_020","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"curl -X GET \"https://cloud.comfy.org/api/user\" \\\n-H \"X-API-Key: $COMFY_CLOUD_API_KEY \"","location_hint":"paragraph 117","char_start":3327,"char_end":3413,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_021","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"ComfyUI workflows are JSON objects describing a graph of nodes. The API accepts workflows in the “API format” (node IDs as keys with class_type, inputs, etc.) as produced by the ComfyUI frontend’s “Save (API Format)” option.","location_hint":"paragraph 122","char_start":3456,"char_end":3680,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_022","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"When you submit a workflow, a job is created. Jobs are executed asynchronously:","location_hint":"paragraph 125","char_start":3695,"char_end":3774,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_023","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"Submit workflow via POST /api/prompt","location_hint":"paragraph 126","char_start":3777,"char_end":3813,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_024","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"Monitor progress via WebSocket or poll for status","location_hint":"paragraph 128","char_start":3845,"char_end":3894,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_025","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"Retrieve outputs when complete","location_hint":"paragraph 129","char_start":3896,"char_end":3926,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_026","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"Parallel Execution (Concurrent Jobs)","location_hint":"paragraph 131","char_start":3937,"char_end":3973,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_027","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"API users can submit multiple workflows concurrently without waiting for previous jobs to complete. Simply send multiple POST /api/prompt requests — no special headers or parameters are needed. The dispatcher will run them in parallel up to your subscription tier’s limit.","location_hint":"paragraph 132","char_start":3975,"char_end":4247,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_028","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"Subscription Tier Concurrent Jobs","location_hint":"paragraph 133","char_start":4251,"char_end":4284,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_029","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"Jobs submitted beyond your concurrency limit will queue normally and execute automatically as slots free up.","location_hint":"paragraph 138","char_start":4328,"char_end":4436,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_030","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"Parallel execution is currently available via the API only. See pricing plans for subscription details.","location_hint":"paragraph 139","char_start":4440,"char_end":4543,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_031","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"Example: Submitting Multiple Jobs in Parallel","location_hint":"paragraph 141","char_start":4552,"char_end":4597,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_032","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"import os\nimport json\nimport asyncio\nimport aiohttp","location_hint":"paragraph 144","char_start":4627,"char_end":4678,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_033","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"BASE_URL = \"https://cloud.comfy.org\"\nAPI_KEY = os.environ[ \"COMFY_CLOUD_API_KEY\" ]","location_hint":"paragraph 145","char_start":4680,"char_end":4762,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_034","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"async def submit_workflow ( session , workflow ):\n\"\"\"Submit a single workflow and return the prompt_id.\"\"\"\nasync with session.post(\nf \" { BASE_URL } /api/prompt\" ,\nheaders = { \"X-API-Key\" : API_KEY , \"Content-Type\" : \"application/json\" },\njson = { \"prompt\" : workflow},\n) as response:\nresult = await response.json()\nreturn result[ \"prompt_id\" ]","location_hint":"paragraph 146","char_start":4764,"char_end":5108,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_035","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"async def main ():\nwith open ( \"workflow_api.json\" ) as f:\nbase_workflow = json.load(f)","location_hint":"paragraph 147","char_start":5110,"char_end":5197,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_036","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"# Create variations by changing the seed\nworkflows = []\nfor seed in [ 42 , 123 , 456 ]:\nworkflow = json.loads(json.dumps(base_workflow))\nworkflow[ \"3\" ][ \"inputs\" ][ \"seed\" ] = seed\nworkflows.append(workflow)","location_hint":"paragraph 148","char_start":5199,"char_end":5407,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_037","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"# Submit all workflows concurrently\nasync with aiohttp.ClientSession() as session:\nprompt_ids = await asyncio.gather(\n* [submit_workflow(session, wf) for wf in workflows]\n)","location_hint":"paragraph 149","char_start":5409,"char_end":5581,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_038","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"for pid in prompt_ids:\nprint ( f \"Job submitted: { pid } \" )","location_hint":"paragraph 150","char_start":5583,"char_end":5643,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_039","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"# Poll or use WebSocket to monitor each job...","location_hint":"paragraph 151","char_start":5645,"char_end":5691,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_040","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"Generated content (images, videos, audio) is stored in cloud storage. Output files can be downloaded via the /api/view endpoint, which returns a 302 redirect to a temporary signed URL.","location_hint":"paragraph 155","char_start":5731,"char_end":5915,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_041","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"Here’s a complete example showing how to submit a workflow, monitor its progress, and retrieve outputs:","location_hint":"paragraph 158","char_start":5937,"char_end":6040,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_042","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"curl -X POST \"https://cloud.comfy.org/api/prompt\" \\\n-H \"X-API-Key: $COMFY_CLOUD_API_KEY \" \\\n-H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n-d &#x27;{\"prompt\": &#x27;\"$( cat workflow_api.json)\"&#x27;}&#x27;","location_hint":"paragraph 164","char_start":6112,"char_end":6308,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_043","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"You can monitor job completion using either polling or WebSocket for real-time updates.","location_hint":"paragraph 167","char_start":6348,"char_end":6435,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_044","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"Job Status Values:\nThe API returns one of the following status values:","location_hint":"paragraph 170","char_start":6472,"char_end":6542,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_045","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"pending Job is queued and waiting to start","location_hint":"paragraph 172","char_start":6568,"char_end":6610,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_046","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"in_progress Job is currently executing","location_hint":"paragraph 173","char_start":6612,"char_end":6650,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_047","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"completed Job finished successfully","location_hint":"paragraph 174","char_start":6652,"char_end":6687,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_048","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"failed Job encountered an error","location_hint":"paragraph 175","char_start":6689,"char_end":6720,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_049","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"cancelled Job was cancelled by user","location_hint":"paragraph 176","char_start":6722,"char_end":6757,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_050","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"# Poll for job completion\ncurl -X GET \" $BASE_URL /api/job/{prompt_id}/status\" \\\n-H \"X-API-Key: $COMFY_CLOUD_API_KEY \"","location_hint":"paragraph 180","char_start":6797,"char_end":6915,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_051","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"# Response examples:\n# {\"status\": \"pending\"} - Job is queued\n# {\"status\": \"in_progress\"} - Job is currently running\n# {\"status\": \"completed\"} - Job finished successfully\n# {\"status\": \"failed\"} - Job encountered an error\n# {\"status\": \"cancelled\"} - Job was cancelled","location_hint":"paragraph 181","char_start":6917,"char_end":7182,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_052","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"Option B: WebSocket (Real-time Progress)","location_hint":"paragraph 183","char_start":7192,"char_end":7232,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_053","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"For real-time progress updates and to collect output metadata:","location_hint":"paragraph 184","char_start":7234,"char_end":7296,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_054","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"async function listenForCompletion (\npromptId : string ,\ntimeout : number = 300000\n) : Promise < Record < string , any >> {\nconst wsUrl = `wss://cloud.comfy.org/ws?clientId= ${ crypto . randomUUID () } &token= ${ API_KEY } ` ;\nconst outputs : Record < string , any > = {};","location_hint":"paragraph 187","char_start":7326,"char_end":7598,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_055","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"return new Promise (( resolve , reject ) => {\nconst ws = new WebSocket ( wsUrl );\nconst timer = setTimeout (() => {\nws . close ();\nreject ( new Error ( `Job did not complete within ${ timeout / 1000 } s` ));\n}, timeout );","location_hint":"paragraph 188","char_start":7600,"char_end":7821,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_056","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"ws . onmessage = ( event ) => {\nconst data = JSON . parse ( event . data );\nconst msgType = data . type ;\nconst msgData = data . data ?? {};","location_hint":"paragraph 189","char_start":7823,"char_end":7963,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_057","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"// Filter to our job\nif ( msgData . prompt_id !== promptId ) return ;","location_hint":"paragraph 190","char_start":7965,"char_end":8034,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_058","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"if ( msgType === \"executing\" ) {\nconst node = msgData . node ;\nif ( node ) {\nconsole . log ( `Executing node: ${ node } ` );\n} else {\nconsole . log ( \"Execution complete\" );\n}\n} else if ( msgType === \"progress\" ) {\nconsole . log ( `Progress: ${ msgData . value } / ${ msgData . max } ` );\n} else if ( msgType === \"executed\" && msgData . output ) {\noutputs [ msgData . node ] = msgData . output ;\n} else if ( msgType === \"execution_success\" ) {\nconsole . log ( \"Job completed successfully!\" );\nclearTimeout ( timer );\nws . close ();\nresolve ( outputs );\n} else if ( msgType === \"execution_error\" ) {\nconst errorMsg = msgData . exception_message ?? \"Unknown error\" ;\nclearTimeout ( timer );\nws . close ();\nreject ( new Error ( `Execution error: ${ errorMsg } ` ));\n}\n};","location_hint":"paragraph 191","char_start":8036,"char_end":8803,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_059","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"ws . onerror = ( err ) => {\nclearTimeout ( timer );\nreject ( err );\n};\n});\n}","location_hint":"paragraph 192","char_start":8805,"char_end":8881,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_060","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"// Wait for completion and collect outputs\nconst outputs = await listenForCompletion ( promptId );","location_hint":"paragraph 193","char_start":8883,"char_end":8981,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_061","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"See WebSocket Reference for detailed message types and handling binary preview images.","location_hint":"paragraph 194","char_start":8986,"char_end":9072,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_062","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"Once the job completes, download the generated files. The outputs object returned from WebSocket (or available via the history endpoint) contains output data organized by node ID. Each node’s output may contain images , video , or audio arrays with file metadata.\nExample outputs structure:","location_hint":"paragraph 197","char_start":9107,"char_end":9397,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_063","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"{\n\"9\" : {\n\"images\" : [\n{\n\"filename\" : \"ComfyUI_00001_.png\" ,\n\"subfolder\" : \"\" ,\n\"type\" : \"output\"\n}\n]\n}\n}","location_hint":"paragraph 198","char_start":9401,"char_end":9506,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_064","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"The node ID ( \"9\" in this example) corresponds to the SaveImage or other output nodes in your workflow. You can find these IDs by opening your workflow JSON file and looking for nodes with class_type like SaveImage , VHS_VideoCombine , etc.","location_hint":"paragraph 199","char_start":9509,"char_end":9749,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_065","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"# Download a single output file (follow 302 redirect with -L)\ncurl -L \" $BASE_URL /api/view?filename=output.png&subfolder=&type=output\" \\\n-H \"X-API-Key: $COMFY_CLOUD_API_KEY \" \\\n-o output.png","location_hint":"paragraph 203","char_start":9787,"char_end":9978,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_066","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"The /api/view endpoint returns a 302 redirect to a temporary signed URL. Your HTTP client must follow redirects to download the file.","location_hint":"paragraph 204","char_start":9983,"char_end":10116,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_067","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"Here’s a full end-to-end example combining all three steps:","location_hint":"paragraph 207","char_start":10143,"char_end":10202,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_068","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"import { readFile , writeFile } from \"fs/promises\" ;","location_hint":"paragraph 210","char_start":10232,"char_end":10284,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_069","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"const BASE_URL = \"https://cloud.comfy.org\" ;\nconst API_KEY = process . env . COMFY_CLOUD_API_KEY ! ;","location_hint":"paragraph 211","char_start":10286,"char_end":10386,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_070","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"async function main () {\n// 1. Load and modify workflow\nconst workflow = JSON . parse ( await readFile ( \"workflow_api.json\" , \"utf-8\" ));\nworkflow [ \"3\" ]. inputs . seed = 42 ;\nworkflow [ \"6\" ]. inputs . text = \"a beautiful sunset\" ;","location_hint":"paragraph 212","char_start":10388,"char_end":10622,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_071","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"// 2. Submit workflow\nconst response = await fetch ( ` ${ BASE_URL } /api/prompt` , {\nmethod: \"POST\" ,\nheaders: { \"X-API-Key\" : API_KEY , \"Content-Type\" : \"application/json\" },\nbody: JSON . stringify ({ prompt: workflow }),\n});\nconst { prompt_id } = await response . json ();\nconsole . log ( `Job submitted: ${ prompt_id } ` );","location_hint":"paragraph 213","char_start":10624,"char_end":10951,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_072","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"// 3. Poll for completion\nwhile ( true ) {\nconst statusRes = await fetch ( ` ${ BASE_URL } /api/job/ ${ prompt_id } /status` , {\nheaders: { \"X-API-Key\" : API_KEY },\n});\nconst { status } = await statusRes . json ();","location_hint":"paragraph 214","char_start":10953,"char_end":11167,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_073","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"if ( status === \"completed\" ) break ;\nif ([ \"failed\" , \"cancelled\" ]. includes ( status )) {\nthrow new Error ( `Job ${ status } ` );\n}\nawait new Promise (( resolve ) => setTimeout ( resolve , 2000 ));\n}","location_hint":"paragraph 215","char_start":11169,"char_end":11371,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_074","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"// 4. Get outputs via job detail endpoint\nconst jobRes = await fetch ( ` ${ BASE_URL } /api/jobs/ ${ prompt_id } ` , {\nheaders: { \"X-API-Key\" : API_KEY },\n});\nconst job = await jobRes . json ();\nconst outputs = job . outputs ;","location_hint":"paragraph 216","char_start":11373,"char_end":11599,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_72d8ae653457_075","source_id":"src_72d8ae653457","source_hash":"c412425fc8f0e16e7822d619c211451c8983275d6ecc602abbaaa3f533ff89fc","text":"// 5. Download output files\nfor ( const nodeOutputs of Object . values ( outputs )) {\nfor ( const fileInfo of ( nodeOutputs as any ). images ?? []) {\nconst params = new URLSearchParams ({\nfilename: fileInfo . filename ,\nsubfolder: fileInfo . subfolder ?? \"\" ,\ntype: \"output\" ,\n});\nconst viewRes = await fetch ( ` ${ BASE_URL } /api/view? ${ params } ` , {\nheaders: { \"X-API-Key\" : API_KEY },\nredirect: \"manual\" ,\n});\nconst signedUrl = viewRes . headers . get ( \"location\" ) ! ;\nconst fileRes = await fetch ( signedUrl );\nawait writeFile ( `./ ${ fileInfo . filename } ` , Buffer . from ( await fileRes . arrayBuffer ()));\nconsole . log ( `Downloaded: ${ fileInfo . filename } ` );\n}\n}\n}","location_hint":"paragraph 217","char_start":11601,"char_end":12287,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T04:42:06.315Z"}
